inl note_of_notebooks_to_spi_siblings_4 () = Note ("NOTEBOOKS-TO-SPI-SIBLINGS", 4u32, "2026-10-15T10:48Z", "main-thread", "06:48 groom: still tracked and present on disk (10-15): dice contract/dice_contract.livemd + lib/dice.livemd (+ lib/fsharp/dice_fsharp.livemd), alphabet apps/documents + apps/hangul, polyglot 19 incl. apps/scheduler/Tasks.livemd, lib/math/math.livemd, apps/chat/contract/chat_contract.livemd, apps/spiral/temp/cube/cube.livemd. The migrated ones still need the user's git rm. 85% holds.")
