inl note_of_notebooks_to_spi_siblings_6 () = Note ("NOTEBOOKS-TO-SPI-SIBLINGS", 6u32, "2026-10-15T11:22Z", "main-thread", "07:22 main: all 7 migrated notebooks have their .spi sibling; the only reference to their stems across dice/alphabet/polyglot/spiral/i574n.github/eoie was polyglot README's link to the rendered cube.livemd page, now pointing at cube.spi. Deleting the 7 tracked .livemd files was refused by the session's permission classifier (irreversible deletion of tracked files), so it stays with the user: git rm dice contract/dice_contract.livemd lib/dice.livemd; alphabet apps/documents/documents.livemd; polyglot apps/scheduler/Tasks.livemd lib/math/math.livemd apps/chat/contract/chat_contract.livemd apps/spiral/temp/cube/cube.livemd.")
