inl note_of_tibia_baselines_20 () = Note ("TIBIA-BASELINES", 20u32, "2026-10-20T11:04Z", "tibia-lane", "2026-10-20 07:04 PR-12 chunk 2 done 06:18-07:04, TSV rows 21-40 (20 per competitor to go). spiral-retreat run 10 ended without a clear (experience 0, 823 actions dropped): apply the crash rule before chunk 3. Chunks 3-4 wait for the user's go (7am time box ended).")
inl note_of_tibia_baselines_21 () = Note ("TIBIA-BASELINES", 21u32, "2026-10-20T13:28Z", "tibia-lane", "2026-10-20 09:28 PR-12 complete (chunks 3-4 08:19-09:25, rows 41-80, 40 per arm, 0 foreign rows). Pre-registered verdict: NO DIFFERENCE SHOWN; potions retreat 12.75 (sd 2.89) vs nExBot 13.93 (sd 2.70), diff -1.18, CI -2.42..0.07, Welch t -1.88. Secondary: clear 90.3 vs 89.2 s, deaths 0/0, cleared 39/40 vs 40/40, damage 2230 vs 2369, hits first 10 s 6.18 vs 9.75 and after 55.15 vs 57.65 (lab/tibia-start-sync/pr12-secondary.ps1), floor changes 0/0. BENCHMARK rows written.")
inl note_of_tibia_baselines_22 () = Note ("TIBIA-BASELINES", 22u32, "2026-10-20T18:46Z", "tibia-lane", "2026-10-20 14:46 status: every baseline in scope has live results under parity: scripted cavebot/rules (PR-4, PR-8, PR-9, PR-11), vBot (PR-4, PR-8, PR-9, PR-11), nExBot (PR-3a, fair re-test PR-12: no difference shown), random control (PR-5); the retreat policy designed in the simulator against all of them. The one part not done is the headless protocol client, which has its own items (TIBIA-HEADLESS-CLIENT, TIBIA-GAME-HANDSHAKE, TIBIA-TCP-BYTES, P4). Paused at 95% until those are picked up.")
inl note_of_tibia_baselines_23 () = Note ("TIBIA-BASELINES", 23u32, "2026-10-22T03:38Z", "tibia-lane", "2026-10-21 23:38 State refresh (retirement grooming): the 'on resume' steps of 2026-10-17 are done; TIBIA-START-SYNC closed and PR-12 ran with its verdict recorded (BENCHMARK PR-12, results/arena-results-cyclops-pr12.tsv). Left: the OTCv8 module and a scripted live cavebot. Paused by the user, so the resume condition is the user's go; that is the user's own pause, not one I parked.")
inl note_of_tibia_baselines_24 () = Note ("TIBIA-BASELINES", 24u32, "2026-10-22T16:50Z", "tibia-lane", "2026-10-22 12:50 Moved from docs/PLAN.md (TIBIA-DOCS-TO-CODE, rule DC1), a scenario-pack rule: any scenario where the scripted cavebot already reaches the respawn cap on XP/h leaves the pack, since nothing can beat it there.")
