inl note_of_bundler_debug_stack_overflow_3 () = Note ("BUNDLER-DEBUG-STACK-OVERFLOW", 3u32, "2026-10-14T16:31Z", "main-thread", "12:31 big-body overflow fixed at the root (pack-1d candidate): the typechecker, its deferred fill and the prepass all run as Hopac jobs on worker threads with the default stack. Each per-call wrapper only moved the overflow to the next stage. Fix: Program.fs sets Hopac's Scheduler.Create MaxStackSize = 256 MB for both cores; the core wrappers are reverted. With pack-1d, 2000- and 3000-let bodies compile and run (236 and 228, both checked by hand) and the 1000-module corpus compiles in 93.8 s. Regression sample: samples/typecheck_long_let_body. The Debug mega_brzozowski check (Tailcalls) still needs a Debug build.")
