inl note_of_x_client_4 () = Note ("X-CLIENT", 4u32, "2026-10-16T02:11Z", "claude", "(2026-10-15 22:11 -04:00, Claude b7595ac3) Renamed from apps/timeline. OAuth2 client credentials (client_credentials grant on /2/oauth2/token with client_type+scope) yield a token the v2 read endpoints refuse (403 Unsupported Authentication 'Unknown'); the app-only Bearer Token from console Keys & Tokens is required. A first Generate was read through the accessibility tree, which truncates at 100 chars (401); the regenerate click was then blocked by the session's permission classifier, so the user copies a fresh token. Client id/secret saved in ~/.secrets/x-api.env (user-only ACL). Live plan: BBCBreaking+SkyNewsBreak (3 follows each), WSJbreakingnews (0 follows).")
inl note_of_x_client_5 () = Note ("X-CLIENT", 5u32, "2026-10-16T02:21Z", "claude", "(2026-10-15 22:21 -04:00, Claude b7595ac3) 280 experiment: 193 top-level blocks all <= 280 X weight (max 276; before: 24 of 96 over, max 1595, measured with a splitter that also glued ///> lines onto the previous block); .spi x-compat findings 0 (whole folder 49 -> 35, all 35 in the tutorial); exe size flat (1,458,688 vs 1,458,176 bytes), generated Rust +6%, source +51% lines (mostly tests). Tests: 22 blocks on zig+rust (prelude 2, posts 3, cli 9, x_api 8 incl. 2 negative GADT tests pinned to their Expected text and mutation-checked). Free live 401 via TLS OK with spindle.exe.")
