inl note_of_kino_rust_crates_13 () = Note ("KINO-RUST-CRATES", 13u32, "2026-10-24T11:49Z", "main", "2026-10-19 laps folded from the deleted history ledger (docs/agents/history/2026-10-19-backlog-laps, HISTORY-BACKLOG-LAPS-DRIFT): lap 5 11:47 (subagent): compiler crates: fields-table patch + probe package + run.ps1 staged and queued -> next: read the candidate run; then Cells mount reading crates: | lap 6 18:26 (subagent): crates: section compiles on the installed compiler (part a in); 60 Active -> next: part b: Cells mount reads crates: into -d tokens | lap 8 20:42 (subagent): Done: Cells reads crates: into rust deps; e2e itoa 1/1; mix 39 passed -> next: -")
