inl note_of_x_cells_split_10 () = Note ("X-CELLS-SPLIT", 10u32, "2026-10-20T03:35Z", "x-lane", "2026-10-19 23:35 x lane owns every x-domain item (user 10-19 23:3x via main: each window does all things of its domain). WSJF order (cost of delay / remaining size): X-CLIENT-THREADS (run step) > X-COMPAT-BLOCK-WEIGHT (~40 cells) > X-REPO-TEMPLATE (gh-pages job, actions.lock rule) > SOCIAL-TRANSPORT-SIM (scale runs) > X-CELLS-SPLIT / SIM-IN-SPIRAL-BULK slices; X-ON-NEAR and NEAR-* stay deferred (user 10-18)")
