inl xc005_postable_budget () = Task ("XC005-POSTABLE-BUDGET", "compiler (main lane): install XC005's postable budget, so --x-compat checks top-level block i against 280 - weight('c<i> 1/1' + newline) - defused dots instead of a flat 280 (lab X-COMPAT-BLOCK-WEIGHT/postable-budget.ps1, proven 2026-10-20 19:42 on Debug candidate core 87B3A977D3497AA0: 29 findings on x HEAD 61b8fff from before x's cell fixes, 0 on the current client, matching xc post-thread --dry-run); after the install the x lane reruns --x-compat on apps/client (expect 0). Split out of X-COMPAT-BLOCK-WEIGHT, whose x side is done", TaskKind, P3, D2, 100u32, Done, "", "compiler,x-compat", "current", "current")
