inl note_of_eoie_generic_drift_1 () = Note ("EOIE-GENERIC-DRIFT", 1u32, "2026-10-22T02:11Z", "eoie", "22:11 live src: agile_task_query team union (main|x|tibia|eoie, TIBIA/X-/SIM-/SOCIAL- prefixes, main fallback) replaced by on_team word = tag listed or ID starts with UPPER(word)-; eoie_team_of export + subagent window_task rule removed; usage strings in subcommand/resume generic; fixtures neutralized (table_cli arena/potions/spiral, notes/windows/run tibia labels, todo model TIBIA/Alphabet/DIB, planning kino, notebook.spi kino var); README team text. Backlog: 110 open fallback items tagged main (backup scratch agile.spi.before-team-tags.*). Deferred to after r34 (anchors): lab/EOIE-RELEASE-TRAIN/apply-neutral-fixtures.ps1 (experiments/logs/table_test Tibia log vocabulary), appended to apply-r34.ps1. Open: memory/claude.spi in the eoie repo follows the 10-17 'memory in eoie git' direction but conflicts with generic eoie: user decision.")
