inl note_of_eoie_generic_drift_4 () = Note ("EOIE-GENERIC-DRIFT", 4u32, "2026-10-22T07:50Z", "eoie", "03:50 audit of the live tree after ABC's neutral fixtures: src/*.spi has 4 game-domain fixture lines left (eoie_table_query query.spi 74-75, stats.spi 116/132: potions, cleared_ms, lowest_health); AGENTS.md's style sources name x's and tibia's modules; spec/one-call.md quotes a mined habit naming 3 repos. Slice apply-generic-drift.ps1 (dry-run clean on copies): fixtures use the retries/latency_ms/free_mb domain table_cli already uses, AGENTS.md describes the boundary and domain-module patterns instead of naming projects, the spec habit uses app/lib/tool. Kept on purpose: the spiral repo URL in README/workspace.ps1 (eoie's own compiler dependency), FIRST-COMMIT-REVIEW.md's historical runner note, memory/claude.spi (waits on the user's call in the morning report). Applies after the ABC tail (tree lease); goes in the second lab handoff.")
inl note_of_eoie_generic_drift_5 () = Note ("EOIE-GENERIC-DRIFT", 5u32, "2026-10-22T13:52Z", "eoie-lane", "09:52 eoie team: sweep with ripgrep (target, lab, .cache and state excluded): 0 hits in src/*.spi; 4 elsewhere. Fixed in place (uncommitted, no compile involved): gh-pages.yml's deploy check built its URL from a hardcoded owner and now uses github.repository_owner (also right on forks); FIRST-COMMIT-REVIEW.md named the local account, now 'a 5-character user name' (the 412-character arithmetic depends only on the length). Kept by rule: README.md:143 and compiler-contracts/workspace.ps1:6 name the Spiral compiler's repository URL, which is eoie's actual dependency location, the way a package registry URL is, not project or user data.")
inl note_of_eoie_generic_drift_6 () = Note ("EOIE-GENERIC-DRIFT", 6u32, "2026-10-22T19:41Z", "eoie-lane", "15:41 pre-release check for GE2+H (rule from note 3): guard-dry src (*.spi, *.spiproj, Cargo.toml, *.md), the five draft crate folders (table-sequences, mirror-check, env-pins, log-sequences, repo-affected), live src/eoie_job_supervise and every apply-readme-*.ps1 grepped for lane/project names, user paths and game-domain fixtures: 0 hits. GE2 and H add no external knowledge.")
