inl eoie_do_move_range () = Task ("EOIE-DO-MOVE-RANGE", "eoie do structural edits in one program: move a line range or definition into a new file, rename or move a file, delete a bounded range with boundary checks, clone a folder family with checked substitutions; a split plan measures with the same line count as the 1,000-line gate and refuses a split with no gain (EDIT-5, EDIT-6, EDIT-7 later)", Story, P2, D4, 0u32, Planned, "EOIE-EDIT-BATCH", "eoie,do,consolidated", "current", "current")
