inl eoie_scratch_copy () = Task ("EOIE-SCRATCH-COPY", "eoie scratch copy: one call makes a disposable copy of a repo from declared includes (src and spec, minus target and .cache), each path declared real copy or junction, with an identity receipt (source hash, state) and recreate-on-failure; gates and benches run there, never on the live tree (FS-1, FS-6, FS-7, EVID-8, BENCH-2, FIXT-4)", Story, P1, D4, 0u32, Planned, "EOIE-HEAL-BOUNDARY", "eoie,fs,consolidated", "current", "current")
