inl eoie_remove_plan () = Task ("EOIE-REMOVE-PLAN", "eoie remove as a plan: candidates from a prewritten rule, a stem grep across sibling repos (dangling-check-by-stem), bytes recovered, dry-run, then apply with a receipt; later, coverage-backed dead-code candidates (FS-4, eoie block: llms fear deleting code)", Story, P2, D4, 0u32, Planned, "EOIE-TREE-DIFF", "eoie,fs,consolidated", "current", "current")
