inl note_of_history_backlog_laps_drift_1 () = Note ("HISTORY-BACKLOG-LAPS-DRIFT", 1u32, "2026-10-24T11:49Z", "main", "2026-10-24 07:49 main: how the drift came to be: on 2026-10-22 00:09 I drained the lab by MOVING the laps ledger and its side tables into docs/agents/history instead of folding them into their items (BACKLOG-LAPS note 4), creating a second record of facts the backlog owns. Healed: 106 items got one note each with their uncovered lap grains (709 of 1,150 grains already had a lap note); 10 helper patch rows went to their items; heavy-queue.tsv, night-queue.tsv and owners.tsv were run state (queue history, a 10-19 owner table now carried by team tags) and are dropped; pack-8 bisect results: pack8-bisect-results-20261019-1401.tsv:  || pack8-bisect-results-20261019-1405.tsv: SPIRAL-LITERAL-ALIAS-SPECIALIZATION built ok ok; SPIRAL-ASSIGN-PRIMITIVE built ok ok; RUST-MATCH-DUPLICATION built TracedError: Expected a symbol as the index into the layout type. TracedError: Expected a symbol as the index into the layout type.; SPIRAL-LITERAL-DEFAULTS built ok ok; RUST-EXPORT-TYPES built ok ok; KINO-RUST-CRATES built ok ok; SPIRAL-UNFORGEABLE-WITNESSES build-fail  . Orphans (ids without a task): -: lap 4-end 14:42 (main): lap 4 done: 35 items, 2 closed (CI-AFTER-SPI-MIGRATION, UPSTREAM-SYNTAX-SYNC) -> next: drive LAB-IN-REPO to Done | lap 6-end 21:34 (main): main laps 4-6 done; packs 7, 8b, 9, 11, 12 accepted and 10 installed today; matrix 7,020 -> 7,276 rows; core v1 consumers dice/alphabet/polyglot migrated -> next: next session: toolchain pack, lane 2 width stack, zig-dev pack || (bookkeeping): lap drive7 11:42 (subagent2): no item reachable to Done CPU-light this lap (all wait on the switch, pack 7 or a push); corrected stale progress: CELLS-PROBES 60, ZIG-PRIMARY-ORACLE 80, LIB-USAGE-DIAGNOSTICS 40, UPSTREAM-CHANGES-POST 20, SIM-IN-SPIRAL 5 -> next: drive ZIG-PRIMARY-ORACLE / SPIRAL-DIAGNOSTIC-LOCATIONS once main applies | lap 9-stop 13:00 (subagent2): lap 9 paused for a context restart after CALYX-BACKEND; lap 8 complete + drive8 (LIB-USAGE delete-unused staging) -> next: next incarnation: continue lap 9 at OPENQASM3-BACKEND (then EBPF, ZED, LEAN, TREE-SITTER, GLEAM, MEGA, CELLS-GATE-MACHINE-WINDOW) | lap 11-stop 13:58 (subagent2): laps 9 (from OPENQASM3) through 11 complete, context restart point -> next: next incarnation: lap 12 from the top of the slice (SPIRAL-CLI-GRANULAR); read the latest notes of an item before setting Done | lap 17-stop 17:15 (subagent2): resume point: laps 12-17 done; drive = SPIRAL-CLI-GRANULAR (lab/SPIRAL-CLI-GRANULAR: 6 crates + cli_common + router.spi; promote.ps1 routes 7 verbs; router_swap.py staged; gleam + rust re-proven with current files (parity with release CLI); cuda, cpp, lua, export need a re-proof from current files (cli_common changed: multi-value flag_values, write_if_changed; cell headers added) before main's promote; rust --wasm/--contract never run: route native only). Staged for main (unchanged): nan-arms/lean-arms/known-platform ALREADY APPLIED (drop from list), pin-stale --run 125623 --apply, drop-polyglot-fallbacks, subword, lean-stable, console_c_arm (Cells), dice-drop-common + rewrite-deps (go), near-sdk-bump row, Calyx 13-sample probe row. Memory suggestions for main: a parameter named with silently drops the definition (ETY-UnboundVariable at call sites); eoie job timeout includes heavy-gate wait (use long budgets, work stays < 2 min); release CLI prints rust results flat, cuda wrapped -> next: next: re-proof jobs (cuda+cpp, lua, export), proven.tsv hashes in promote.ps1, then lap 18 | lap 18 18:04 (subagent2): lap 18 pass: no change since lap 17 (all waiting on main's queue, user's go or deps) for KINO-HOT-PATHS, LIB-USAGE-DIAGNOSTICS, CI-OFFLOAD, TODO-AS-SOURCE, CELLS-PROBES, CELLS-NEW-PROJECT, SIM-IN-SPIRAL, TREE-PAGES-EVERY-REPO, UPSTREAM-POST-1-VANILLA, RUST-NIGHTLY-EVERYWHERE, WORKFLOW-END-TO-END, SPIRAL-INDEPENDENT, OPENQASM3-BACKEND (main runs its probe), EBP