heck -> next: - || (none): lap drive7b 12:01 (subagent2): no item can reach Done before the all-clear; first Done candidates after it: ZIG-PRIMARY-ORACLE (flip + reviewed accept), SPIRAL-DIAGNOSTIC-LOCATIONS (pack 7 review), TREE-PAGES-EVERY-REPO (sweep.ps1 OK after a push) -> next: - || SEFAZ-XSD-APP: lap 1 08:12 (subagent): lib has no XML reader; roxmltree primitive vs Spiral tokenizer; KINO-RUST-CRATES dependency for tests -> next: on go: decide reader by a 50-line Spiral tokenizer probe over tiposBasico_v4.00.xsd vs roxmltree; record the dep on KINO-RUST-CRATES if roxmltree | lap 2 09:05 (subagent): tiposBasico_v4.00: 13 element kinds, 7 attrs, no CDATA/entities: a small Spiral tokenizer suffices -> next: on go: check leiauteNFe_v4.00.xsd the same way (choices, complexTypes, entities) before fixing the tokenizer scope | lap 3 10:21 (subagent): leiauteNFe v4.00 shape: 21 kinds, 20 attrs, only &quot;/&amp; entities, no CDATA; tokenizer needs PI skip + 5 entities -> next: on go: write the XSD-subset tokenizer union (Tag/End/SelfClosing/Text/Comment/Pi) in Spiral with test blocks; else nothing | lap 4 11:29 (subagent): blocked: research-only until the user's explicit go (both input files sized) -> next: the user's go; then the XSD tokenizer | lap 5 12:19 (subagent): research-only until the user's go -> next: the user's go | lap 6 18:26 (subagent): re-read: research sizing done (21 element kinds in leiauteNFe_v4.00) -> next: map the 21 kinds onto Spiral unions in a lab sketch | lap 7 19:54 (subagent): re-read: research-only so far -> next: map the 21 XSD kinds onto Spiral unions. The folder is deleted.")
