inl note_of_pages_sweep_place_1 () = Note ("PAGES-SWEEP-PLACE", 1u32, "2026-10-24T11:45Z", "main", "2026-10-24 07:45 main: origin: the sweep.ps1 of TREE-PAGES-EVERY-REPO lap 12 (2026-10-19), a cross-repo check of every org page for the features dir-tree-html renders (README section, viewport meta, portrait media query, gh-pages/main heads). It reached spiral/scripts in the 10-24 commit. Rule: a check lives with the product it checks, so it moved to dir-tree-html/pages-sweep.ps1 (hash-identical; removed from spiral/scripts, both uncommitted for the user). Next step under SPIRAL-SCRIPT-TESTS: a test block in dir_tree_html.spi replaces the pwsh.")
inl note_of_pages_sweep_place_2 () = Note ("PAGES-SWEEP-PLACE", 2u32, "2026-10-24T23:53Z", "main", "2026-10-24 19:53 main correction: the 07:45 rule (a check lives with the product it checks) was misapplied. pages-sweep.ps1 checks every org repo's deployed page (10 repos, .github among them), not dir-tree-html's code, so it is org tooling and belongs with workflow.ps1 in the org .github repo. Moved to i574n.github/scripts/pages-sweep.ps1 (hash 9188C6583644C400, parse 0; removed from dir-tree-html; uncommitted for the user). No references to update.")
